# --- Personal data: NEVER commit -------------------------------------------
# Source exports contain names, badge IDs, daily movements and medical/parental
# leave records for ~162 identifiable employees. See AGENTS.md §2.3.
#
# `data/` holds both inputs (data/raw/<YYYY-MM>/) and generated reports
# (data/out/<YYYY-MM>/). Neither belongs in git.
data/

# Belt and braces: no spreadsheet or document anywhere, except the two
# whitelisted locations below.
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.docx

# Vendor reference material — no employee data, useful to future readers.
!docs/reference/*.xlsx
!docs/reference/*.docx
# Test fixtures use synthetic names only.
!tests/fixtures/*.xlsx

# Excel lock files
~$*

# The report's machine-readable companion (src/mesai/snapshot.py). Holds names,
# e-mail addresses and hours for every employee — the mail step reads it instead of
# parsing the workbook. Written next to the program, never committed.
veri/
gonderim-*.json

# --- Files that must hold REAL employee names -------------------------------
# The alias table has to match the spellings in the source files exactly, so it
# cannot be pseudonymised. Committed as personel.example.yaml instead.
config/personel.yaml

# Pseudonym -> real name mapping for the docs. Internal only.
*.local.md

# --- Python -----------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# --- Secrets ----------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# --- Editors / OS -----------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
